## 6. Important Python Concepts Used

### `while True`

Used to keep the chatbot running continuously until the user chooses to exit.

### `if / elif / else`

Used to check the user's input and select the appropriate chatbot response.

### `input()`

Used to receive messages and calculator values from the user.

### `random.choice()`

Used to randomly select one joke from the joke list.

### `float()`

Used to convert calculator input into numbers that can contain decimal values.

### `break`

Used to stop the `while` loop when the user enters `exit`, `quit`, or `bye`.

